   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Pipeline ML — Prédiction du risque d'annulation\n",
    "**Maeva — Mastère 2 DIA Paris**\n",
    "\n",
    "Pipeline complet :\n",
    "1. Chargement & nettoyage\n",
    "2. Feature engineering (variables dérivées)\n",
    "3. Gestion du déséquilibre (SMOTE + class_weight)\n",
    "4. Préprocessing (imputation, scaling, OHE)\n",
    "5. Entraînement de 3 modèles (LR → RF → XGBoost)\n",
    "6. Optimisation des hyperparamètres (RandomizedSearchCV)\n",
    "7. Évaluation complète (ROC, PR, matrice de confusion)\n",
    "8. Interprétabilité SHAP\n",
    "9. Export du modèle final\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 0. Installation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
